# Two readings (the list form) of the one written Structure are admitted with different sets of formals -- as
# written (the group to @: value Model, Model empty) and opened (the const Structure to value, other := 1) -- so
# the call is ambiguous: 3, nothing runs, calls 0 (fable 2026-11-18).
int: calls 0
@: Model ()
fn: take (@: value Model; int: other) int
    node\calls := node\calls + 1
    return: other
int: result take((const(@: value Model); int: other 1))
